{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_module_1_foundation", "label": "Module 1 \u2014 Foundation", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a71.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only module with no upstream dependencies, consumed by all 39 others; enforces tenancy at the database via RLS rather than application-layer WHERE filters because a forgotten filter leaks PHI and competitors cannot retrofit it."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_seam_registry", "label": "Seam Registry & Boot-Time Validation (validateSeams)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.18 / M01-F04", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "registerSeam/registerEraser plus REQUIRED_SEAMS with deny-stub defaults, validated after module init and before server.listen(); the boot fails when a PHI data class has no DataEraser or a required seam is unregistered \u2014 fail-loud at startup rather than at first call."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_outbox_event_catalog", "label": "Outbox Event Catalog (D8)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.17 / \u00a711.2 D8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mirrors M4's audit-action catalog: outbox events cross module boundaries, so the payload schema is a cross-module integration surface deserving boot-validation plus per-call validation. Refuse-on-validation-failure prevents bad events polluting the queue; the publishing transaction rolls back."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_cmsr_registry", "label": "Cross-Module Schema Request (CMSR) Registry (D7)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.16 / \u00a711.2 D7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Catches the failure mode 'M29 needs an enum value on M4 but the M4 owner doesn't know'. YAML is human-readable, diff-friendly and machine-parseable; a CI rule greps spec PRs for cross-module schema language and asserts a matching approved CMSR exists."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_organization_settings_registry", "label": "Organization-Settings Registry + validate_organization_settings() Trigger (D6)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.15 / \u00a711.2 D6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A trigger on M1's organization table fires regardless of which app-layer service writes the row; putting cross-tenant uniqueness checks in M5's service layer would miss writes coming through the platform-admin route. SECURITY DEFINER + SET search_path + partial UNIQUE index back the uniqueAcrossTenants keys."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_rls_policy_generator", "label": "RLS Policy Generator (packages/tenancy)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A TypeScript generator emitting SQL at migration-authoring time, so consuming modules never call a nonexistent SQL wardenx_enable_rls() function (M04-F07)."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_with_org_context", "label": "withOrgContext (canonical app.org_id RLS context helper)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_with_platform_context", "label": "withPlatformContext (separately-pooled platform credential, allowlisted)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.14 / M01-F05", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No longer SET ROLE wardenx_admin on the tenant pool: it runs against a separately-pooled platform credential, gated by a platform-job allowlist, with cross-tenant scope audited at severity=critical. wardenx_admin stays confined to migration-runner and break-glass."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_envelope_encryption", "label": "App-Layer Envelope Encryption (AES-256-GCM, D1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a711.1 D1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pgcrypto-symmetric was rejected because key rotation requires a full table rewrite, versus envelope encryption where DEK rotation is a per-row re-wrap. Reused by M2 passkey blobs, M5 identifiers, M22 document storage, M29 HL7 ciphers, M40 BAA metadata."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_outbox_dispatcher", "label": "Outbox Dispatcher Worker (separate container, D4)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a711.1 D4 / \u00a74.8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A separate worker container gives independent scaling, failure isolation from API serving, and independent connection-pool budgeting; in-process is an opt-in for dev/CI only. Max 8 attempts, exponential backoff, outbox.dlq, no silent drop."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_feature_flag_governance", "label": "Feature Flag Governance (four flag kinds, read-time evaluation D3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a713 / \u00a711.1 D3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pre-computed-on-org-load was rejected because per-user targeting varies per request (contextHash includes role, location, discipline) and kill-switch activation must propagate globally in under 60 seconds."}, {"id": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_two_tier_session_storage", "label": "Two-Tier Session Storage (Postgres canonical + Valkey 60s cache, D2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a711.1 D2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Postgres-only is too slow at the per-request authorize layer (M3's pipeline expects p95 < 3ms); pure-Valkey is too volatile because session data must survive restarts for survey-readiness audit replay."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_module_1_foundation", "target": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_seam_registry", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.18", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_module_1_foundation", "target": "docs_modules_wardenx_module_01_foundation_spec_v0_4_outbox_event_catalog", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/modules/WARDENX_MODULE_01_FOUNDATION_SPEC_v0_4.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.17", "weight"